--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
PER-DIRECTORY LICENSING
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

Licensing is assigned at the directory level. The authoritative mapping
is maintained in:

  https://github.com/pointsav/factory-release-engineering/blob/main/mapping/repo-license-map.yaml

Directories under AGPL-3.0-or-later:

  os-console/        — platform console
  os-workplace/      — workplace module
  service-*/         — all platform services
  system-*/          — all platform systems
  tool-*/            — all platform tools (except tool-wallet/, see Apache-2.0 below)
  moonshot-*/        — experimental and speculative work (except the five
                       FSL-1.1-ALv2 overrides listed below)
  app-console-*/     — applications extending os-console
  app-workplace-*/   — applications extending os-workplace
  xtask/             — workspace build-task runner
  pointsav-pty-bridge/ — PTY bridge service
  foundry-nodeclass/ — workspace node classification library
  scripts/           — workspace build and automation scripts
  slm/               — language model module configuration
  docs/              — internal technical documentation

Directories under FSL-1.1-ALv2 (Functional Source License 1.1 with
Apache-2.0 future license):

  os-infrastructure/   — infrastructure module
  os-privategit/       — private git / storefront engine module
  os-totebox/          — sovereign data vault module
  os-mediakit/         — media kit module
  os-network-admin/    — network administration module
  app-privategit-*/    — applications extending os-privategit
  app-totebox-*/       — applications extending os-totebox
  app-mediakit-*/      — applications extending os-mediakit
  app-network-*/       — applications extending os-network-admin
  templates/           — HTML/CSS shell templates for app-mediakit surfaces
  moonshot-docengine/  — document-engine infrastructure (override of moonshot-* default)
  moonshot-editor/     — editor/viewer/file-tree widget surface (override)
  moonshot-crdt/       — collaborative state / version-lineage engine (override)
  moonshot-parser/     — incremental syntax parser (override)
  moonshot-bim-engine/ — sovereign IFC/BIM engine (override)

Directories under Apache-2.0:

  tool-wallet/  — payment/wallet tooling (override of tool-* default; no
                  revenue role, seeds the Binary Library Open Source shelf)

Directories under PointSav-ARR (proprietary — permanent commercial moat,
not distributed under either the AGPL commercial-alternative tier or the
FSL tier described below):

  os-interface/        — orchestration/aggregation module (renames to
                         os-orchestration/; both currently exist mid-rename)
  os-orchestration/    — rename target of os-interface/, above
  app-orchestration-*/ — applications extending os-interface/os-orchestration

Directories carrying upstream third-party licenses (vendored code; not
relicensed or SPDX-stamped by this repository's tooling):

  vendor-virtio/          — virtio driver stubs; see vendor-virtio/README.md for SPDX
  vendor-wireguard/       — WireGuard tooling; see vendor-wireguard/README.md for SPDX
  vendor-azure-auth/      — Microsoft Azure authentication libraries
  vendor-gpu-drivers/     — GPU driver packages
  vendor-linux-systemd/   — systemd library bindings (LGPL-2.1-or-later)
  vendor-microsoft-graph/ — Microsoft Graph SDK
  vendor-phi3-mini/       — Phi-3 Mini model weights (MIT, Microsoft Research)
  vendor-sel4-kernel/     — seL4 microkernel source (GPL-2.0-only, Data61/CSIRO)
  vendor-slm-engine/      — local language model engine

The full AGPL-3.0-or-later text is available at:
  https://github.com/pointsav/factory-release-engineering/blob/main/licenses/AGPL-3.0.txt

The full FSL-1.1-ALv2 text is available at:
  https://github.com/pointsav/factory-release-engineering/blob/main/licenses/FSL-1.1-Apache-2.0.txt

The full Apache-2.0 text is available at:
  https://github.com/pointsav/factory-release-engineering/blob/main/licenses/Apache-2.0.txt

The full PointSav-ARR text is available at:
  https://github.com/pointsav/factory-release-engineering/blob/main/licenses/PointSav-ARR.txt

